  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SP - Basecamp Explorer Foundation: Mara-Serengeti Strategic Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to safeguard the Maasai Mara &#x2013; Serengeti ecosystem by bringing marginalised Maasai out of poverty. The project will establish two enterprises that will finance conservation in two important wildlife corridors outside the Maasai Mara national park, as well as providing relevant training to communities in the area.</narrative>
  </description>
